OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA mix of bright spells and a
OL,6,Ffew showers is expected on Monday
OL,7,Fmorning. The afternoon looks mostly
OL,8,Fdry, though fairly cloudy at times.
OL,9,FPleasantly warm in the westerly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FThe
OL,12,Fweather looks rather changeable. There
OL,13,Fwill be some warm sunshine at times.
OL,14,FHowever, showers are also likely,
OL,15,Fespecially in the north, and it will
OL,16,Fbe breezy for a while.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
